  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine flaked salmon, grated onion, and diced fresh dill.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together flour, egg, milk, and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until combined.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a deep frying pan to 375°F.",
    "Using a 1/4 cup measuring cup, scoop the batter into the hot oil.",
    "Fry the pancakes for 3-4 minutes on each side, until golden brown and cooked through.",
    "Drain the pancakes on paper towels and serve hot with a dollop of sour cream or applesauce.",
    "If desired, add a pat of melted lard on top of each pancake for extra richness."
